# Screenshot: Calendar invite in the email view, using sample data.
Output screenshots/calendar_view.gif

Set FontSize 14
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font"
Set Width 1400
Set Height 800
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set WindowBarSize 40
Set BorderRadius 10

Hide
Type "TZ=UTC go run ./screenshots/cmd/calendar_view"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Show
Sleep 1s

Screenshot screenshots/calendar_view.png
Sleep 1s
